._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Logs
*.log

# Large downloaded 3D source assets (re-fetch with assets/tools/fetch_polyhaven.py; Sketchfab items per assets/models/README.md)
